#import "../utils.typst": linear_translation


#linear_translation(
[עַֽל־נַֽהֲר֨וֹת | בָּבֶ֗ל שָׁ֣ם יָ֖שַׁבְנוּ גַּם־בָּכִ֑ינוּ בְּ֜זָכְרֵ֗נוּ אֶת־צִיּֽוֹן:],
[By the rivers of Babylon, there we sat and also wept, as we remembered Tzion.])
#linear_translation(
[עַל־עֲרָבִ֥ים בְּתוֹכָ֑הּ תָּ֜לִ֗ינוּ כִּנֹּֽרוֹתֵֽינוּ:],
[Upon the willows in its midst we hung our harps.])
#linear_translation(
[כִּ֚י שָׁ֨ם שְׁאֵל֪וּנוּ שׁוֹבֵ֡ינוּ דִּבְרֵי־שִׁ֖יר וְתוֹלָלֵ֣ינוּ שִׂמְחָ֑ה שִׁ֥ירוּ לָ֜֗נוּ מִשִּׁ֥יר צִיּֽוֹן:],
[For there our captors demanded of us words of song, and our tormentors demanded joy, [saying]: "Sing for us from the song of Tzion!"])
#linear_translation(
[אֵ֗יךְ נָ֖שִׁיר אֶת־שִׁ֣יר יְהֹוָ֑ה עַ֜֗ל אַדְמַ֥ת נֵכָֽר:],
[How can we sing the song of Adonoy upon a foreign land?])
#linear_translation(
[אִם־אֶשְׁכָּחֵ֥ךְ יְ֜רֽוּשָׁלִָ֗ם תִּשְׁכַּ֥ח יְמִינִֽי:],
[If I forget you, Yerusholayim, let my right hand forget [its skill].])
#linear_translation(
[תִּדְבַּ֚ק לְשׁוֹנִ֨י | לְחִכִּי֘ אִם־לֹ֪א אֶ֫זְכְּרֵ֥כִי אִם־לֹ֣א אַֽ֖עֲלֶה אֶת־יְרֽוּשָׁלִַ֑ם עַ֜֗ל רֹ֣אשׁ שִׂמְחָתִֽי:],
[Let my tongue cling to my palate if I do not remember you, if I do not elevate Yerusholayim above my foremost joy.])
#linear_translation(
[זְכֹ֚ר יְהֹוָ֨ה | לִבְנֵ֬י אֱד֗וֹם אֵת֘ י֚וֹם יְרֽוּשָׁ֫לִָ֥ם הָ֖אֹֽמְרִים עָ֣רוּ | עָ֑רוּ עַ֜֗ד הַיְס֥וֹד בָּֽהּ:],
[Remember, Adonoy, against the children of Edom, the day of Yerusholayim, who said, "Raze it, raze it, down to its foundation!"])
#linear_translation(
[בַּת־בָּבֶ֗ל הַשְּׁד֫וּדָ֥ה אַשְׁרֵ֥י שֶׁיְשַׁלֶּם־לָ֑ךְ אֶת־גְּ֜מוּלֵ֗ךְ שֶׁגָּמַ֥לְתְּ לָֽנוּ:],
[O daughter of Babylon, destined for destruction, praiseworthy is he who repays you in kind for what you have done to us.])
#linear_translation(
[אַשְׁרֵ֚י | שֶׁיֹּאחֵ֓ז וְנִפֵּ֬ץ אֶת־עֹ֜לָלַ֗יִךְ אֶל־הַסָּֽלַע:],
[Praiseworthy is he who will seize and dash your infants against the rock.])
